  (text "Inter-bank connector, 12 pins: +12V on 5 pins, GND on 5 pins, bus pair BUS_A/BUS_B.\nJ3 takes power and the bus from the head unit or the previous bank, J4 passes them on.\nFootprints are 2.54 mm SMD placeholders (bottom side, no pins through to the plate side) until the blind-mate header is chosen."
